<header>
  <div class="section">your turn</div>
  <h2>change one thing, guess, run, write it down</h2>
  <p class="sub">before each run, write down what you think the test accuracy will be. then run it. were you right?</p>
</header>
<div class="tries">
  <div><code>lr=0.05</code> → <code>0.5</code>, then <code>0.001</code><span>too big a step? too small?</span></div>
  <div><code>STEPS = 5000</code> → <code>200</code><span>how few steps still give 90%?</span></div>
  <div><code>128</code> hidden → <code>16</code>, then <code>1024</code><span>change it in <code>l1</code> and <code>l2</code></span></div>
  <div>delete <code>.relu()</code><span>two matmuls with nothing between them</span></div>
  <div><code>BS = 256</code> → <code>8</code><span>noisier steps. better or worse?</span></div>
  <div>skip the <code>− mean</code><span>does centering the pixels matter?</span></div>
